OL,3,GNEWSAGreen deputy leader questioned on
OL,4,Asmall boats, polling and bin strike on
OL,5,ABBC local radio
OL,6,
OL,7,FMillward faced some tough questions on
OL,8,Flocal issues. Asked about the latest
OL,9,Fposition on Birmingham's bin strike,
OL,10,FMillward says "I haven't got the
OL,11,Finformation. I'm so sorry". The Greens
OL,12,Fhave run the council with the Lib Dems
OL,13,Fand independents since May
OL,15,FThe main Westminster parties have all
OL,16,Fbeen getting a similar opportunity
OL,17,Fbefore their conferences
